===Etymology===
From [[Hindustani]] [[राजा]] / {{ur-Arab|[[راجا]]}} (rājā) < {{etyl|sa}} [[राजा]] (rājā) < [[राजन्]] (rājan)

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|raja}}
{{en-noun}}

